{"title":"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 30","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_30\">Problem 30</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 30\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Each of the equations <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/4/484dccd80d54fe936ee4e2a921f9d5321bfb3712.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x^2-2=25, (2x-1)^2=(x-1)^2, \\sqrt{x^2-7}=\\sqrt{x-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"422\" height=\"21\" /> has: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/1/e016664eeadae2a451430b87126cf103b8d5879f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{two integral roots}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{no root greater than 3}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{no root zero}\\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{only one root}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{one negative root and one positive root}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"548\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the question asks us about the unifying characteristic of all three equations' roots, we have to first determine them.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/e/cbeb7efac91a72f03218a9dcdaa11e546956efae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x^2-2 = 25$\" width=\"100\" height=\"15\" /> can be rewritten as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/2/f12b2720feda20586826caab147898a77a25ba95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x^2 - 27 = 0$\" width=\"100\" height=\"15\" />, which gives the following roots <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/6/a26d26d140649aac91fff6adf22f9c795c935801.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$+3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/3/0b31b51deaa1a9e903d120a02141556c3e70e348.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-3$\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/8/2b8ed7bb8aa6c014397b4f62eca96f470125164d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2x-1)^2 = (x-1)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"158\" height=\"19\" /> can be expanded to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/8/05855c397627311bf8595b4aad9d46b43a17716d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^2-4x+1=x^2-2x+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"214\" height=\"16\" />, which in turn leads to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/6/b464daf97e693d1ac45693c50b728f4209efbfd0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x^2-2x=0$\" width=\"101\" height=\"15\" />. The roots here are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/4/7547747b133453d3c209cff6cfbf129aa67a6947.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/6/246a5c7b7444338e90e0d306f41f90dc5c7853b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{x^2-7}=\\sqrt{x-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"145\" height=\"19\" />, when squared, also turns into a quadratic equation: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/b/1eb5e101e858d10029d9241f2f0a9ebb2a46ae79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 - x - 6 = 0$\" width=\"114\" height=\"15\" />. Binomial factoring gives us the roots <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/a/62a76677add1d246708c86edfc7c4b8a40184914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>We can clearly see that, between all of the equations, there is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/5/7c543f24c8ba8ae2274bd207f324f9cda7c7ea77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)} \\text{no root greater than 3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"202\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>Note: There are probably extraneous solutions somewhere, but that does not affect the solution.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In order to go back to the 1955 AHSME, click <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems\">here</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017002359\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.018 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.030 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 94/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 335/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3050/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.816      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n100.00%    5.816      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:19509:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017002359 and revision id 228537. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}